---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | CivicConnect" description="Read about CivicConnect's policies regarding session storage and data security.">
  <div class="container section max-w-3xl">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="mb-12">
      <span class="badge badge-soft mb-3" data-tone="accent">User Privacy</span>
      <h1 class="text-h1 mb-4">
        Privacy Policy. <span class="text-muted-foreground">Local storage and zero tracking.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-small text-muted-foreground">Effective Date: November 2026</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="space-y-8 text-small leading-relaxed">
      <p class="text-body text-muted-foreground">
        At CivicConnect, we respect your privacy and are committed to complete transparency regarding how data is handled across our platform.
      </p>

      <article class="card space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-h3 text-lg font-medium text-foreground">1. Information We Do Not Collect</h2>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground">
          CivicConnect does not require user accounts, passwords, or personal identity documents to access civic directories. We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal data.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="card space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-h3 text-lg font-medium text-foreground">2. Local Browser Storage & History</h2>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground">
          To provide a seamless experience without cloud account tracking, CivicConnect saves your conversation history, jurisdiction preferences, and bookmarked cards directly in your browser's local storage (<code>localStorage</code>). This data stays strictly on your device. You can purge this data anytime by clearing conversations or wiping browser cache.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="card space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-h3 text-lg font-medium text-foreground">3. Search & Query Processing</h2>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground">
          When you submit questions to the AI assistant, the queries are processed through our retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) pipeline to fetch matching official documents. Queries are evaluated without user identification or profiling.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="card space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-h3 text-lg font-medium text-foreground">4. Feedback Reporting</h2>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground">
          If you provide thumbs up or thumbs down feedback on answers, the report (which includes the message text, citation status, and optional user remarks) is collected strictly so that our editorial team can audit statutory accuracy. This submission is voluntary.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="card space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-h3 text-lg font-medium text-foreground">5. External Portal Links</h2>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground">
          Our citation cards link to official government platforms (e.g. pmjay.gov.in, legislative.gov.in). We are not responsible for the privacy practices or data collection policies of external third-party portals.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
